1
00:00:01,734 --> 00:00:11,811
(Q11（单选）) Thanks for coming everyone. OK, so this meeting is for new staff and staff who haven't been involved with our volunteering projects yet.

2
00:00:11,811 --> 00:00:22,256
So basically, the idea is that we allow staff to give up some of their work time to help on various charity projects to benefit the local community.

3
00:00:22,256 --> 00:00:27,024
We've been doing this for the last five years and it's been very successful.

4
00:00:27,024 --> 00:00:35,689
[Q11答案句 C✅， 8 hours原词出现] Participating doesn't necessarily involve a huge time commitment. The company will pay for eight hours of your time.

5
00:00:35,689 --> 00:00:44,222
[❌ AB 干扰 偷换概念，原文只出现one， two ，说的是 volunteer job给的8小时，可以自己选择在【多长时间段】内用完，+ throughout the year 同义替换， per year] That can be used over one or two days all at once, or spread over several months throughout the year.

6
00:00:44,222 --> 00:00:52,356
There are some staff who enjoy volunteering so much they also give up their own free time for a couple of hours every week.

7
00:00:52,356 --> 00:01:02,530
It's completely up to you. Obviously, many people will have family commitments and aren't as available as other members of staff.

8
00:01:02,530 --> 00:01:06,938
(Q12) Feedback from staff has been overwhelmingly positive.

9
00:01:06,938 --> 00:01:16,257
[Q12答案句  ✅B， 解释型， feel motivated at work = 对工作满意] Because they felt they were doing something really useful, nearly everyone agreed that volunteering made them feel more motivated at work.

10
00:01:16,257 --> 00:01:27,376
[❌C， 偷换概念， relationship原词，但是是with local people， 不是同事。    ❌A 无中生有 没提及promotion] They also liked building relationships with the people in the local community and felt valued by them. One or two people also said it was a good thing to have on their CVs.

11
00:01:27,376 --> 00:01:33,932
(Q13) [定位词 / 考点词 last year] One particularly successful project last year was the Get Working Project.

12
00:01:33,932 --> 00:01:38,876
[定位词又出现 unemployed people] This was aimed at helping unemployed people in the area get back to work.

13
00:01:38,876 --> 00:01:51,762
[Q13答案句 ✅ C： telephone skill = communication skill，且后面还有一大堆解释： 写下messages， speak with confidence] Our staff were able to help them improve their telephone skills, such as writing down messages and speaking with confidence to potential customers, which they had found quite difficult.

14
00:01:51,762 --> 00:02:01,355
[❌B选项原词出现， 但不是这题问的东西。 偷换概念] This is something many employers look for in job applicants - and something we all do without even thinking about, every day at work.

15
00:02:01,355 --> 00:02:09,687
(Q14) We've got an exciting new project starting this year. Up until now, we've mainly focused on projects to do with education and training.

16
00:02:09,687 --> 00:02:15,877
[❌A，C 很干扰： up until now， 表示至今已经在做了，不符合will。  且是 continue with ，都表明不是new的] And we'll continue with our reading project in schools and our work with local charities.

17
00:02:15,877 --> 00:02:22,127
[Q14答案句 ✅ B， 已同意 = 还没开始= will] But we've also agreed to help out on a conservation project in Redfern Park.

18
00:02:22,127 --> 00:02:29,092
So if any of you fancy being outside and getting your hands dirty, this is the project for you.

19
00:02:29,092 --> 00:02:40,074
(Q15) I also want to mention the annual Digital Inclusion Day, which is coming up next month. The aim of this is to help older people keep up with technology.

20
00:02:40,074 --> 00:02:44,840
[❌A， instead of A，排除 否定原文的一种形式] And this year, instead of hosting the event in our own training facility,&nbsp;

21
00:02:44,840 --> 00:02:50,872
[Q15答案句] we're using the ICT suite at Hill College, as it can hold far more people.

22
00:02:50,872 --> 00:03:00,173
[❌C，偷换概念， 邀请来自C 这个center的人参加， 不是举办地点] We've invited over 60 people from the Silver Age Community Centre to take part, so we'll need a lot of volunteers to help with this event.

23
00:03:00,173 --> 00:03:02,167
(Q16) [定位词 take part] If you're interested in taking part,&nbsp;

24
00:03:02,167 --> 00:03:07,925
[Q16答案句  同义替换✅A complete = fill in] please go to the volunteering section of our website and complete the relevant form.

25
00:03:07,925 --> 00:03:16,544
[❌B否定， won't be provide any training] We won't be providing any training for this but you'll be paired with an experienced volunteer if you've never done it before.

26
00:03:16,544 --> 00:03:24,024
[❌C 偷换概念： 告诉经理你要干嘛 不等于 get permission] By the way, don't forget to tell your manager about any volunteering activities you decide to do.

27
00:03:24,024 --> 00:03:34,627
(Q17/18（多选）) The participants on the Digital Inclusion Day really benefited. The majority were in their seventies, though some were younger and a few were even in their nineties!

28
00:03:34,627 --> 00:03:41,786
Quite a few owned both a computer and a mobile phone, but these tended to be outdated models.

29
00:03:41,786 --> 00:03:51,936
They generally knew how to do simple things, like send texts, but weren't aware of recent developments in mobile phone technology.

30
00:03:51,936 --> 00:04:01,282
A few were keen to learn but most were quite dismissive at first - they couldn't see the point of updating their skills. But that soon changed.

31
00:04:01,282 --> 00:04:04,412
(Q19/20（多选）) The feedback was very positive.

32
00:04:04,412 --> 00:04:18,754
The really encouraging thing was that participants all said they felt much more confident about using social media to keep in touch with their grandchildren, who prefer this form of communication to phoning or sending emails.

33
00:04:18,754 --> 00:04:25,836
A lot of them also said playing online games would help them make new friends and keep their brains active.

34
00:04:25,836 --> 00:04:39,091
They weren't that impressed with being able to order their groceries online, as they liked going out to the shops, but some said it would come in handy if they were ill or the weather was really bad.

35
00:04:39,091 --> 00:04:41,591
One thing they asked about was using tablets for things like reading newspapers - some people had been given tablets as presents but had never used them, so that's something we'll make sure we include this time ...

